>> i := 0.
Ijade kọ: ['Can we count to 10 using a whileTrue loop ?'], ila-tuntun.
{ Ijade kọ: i, ila-tuntun. } nigba-ti: { i fi-kun: 1. <- (i ≤ 10). }.
Ijade kọ: ['Can we count back from 10 to 0 using a whileFalse loop ?'], ila-tuntun.
{ Ijade kọ: i, ila-tuntun. } nigba-ti: { i yọ: 1. <- (i ≥ 0). }.
